- Text: Technical SEO and content
architecture work as the
skeleton and central nervous
system of an AEO strategy.

Many marketers consider technical SEO a
set-it-and-forget-it exercise or a job for the
engineering team. In reality, SEO best
practices change with new algorithm updates
and evolving user behavior. A successful AEO
strategy requires regular technical audits to
ensure the website is optimized for Al-powered
answer engines to easily crawl, understand,
and validate content.
