Text:
High AEO team maturity is tied to significantly
better business outcomes
We asked respondents to rate their AEO function’s
overall impact on business outcomes. Then we
correlated their answers with their team maturity
level to reveal the chart on the right.
High AEO team maturity correlates with a much
higher overall impact on business outcomes.
Even more impressive, high-maturity AEO teams are
1.5x more likely to say they’re a top-performing
team within the organization.
Small vs. Large AEO Teams:
Does Size Matter?
We wanted to see if the size of the AEO team
affected business performance. So we asked
respondents to tell us about the number of people
on their teams. The chart below reveals the effect.
Size matters – to a point.
The largest teams (11+ people) have nearly the same
positive impact as the smallest teams (1-3 people),
but the teams in between (4-10 people) seem to
drive better results than both.
