- Context: This page discusses about the next step of AEO. It also gives examples on how to get to the next step of AEO.
- Text: What's the next step for AEO?
When AI changes as fast as it does, what works today may not work tomorrow. AEO
leaders are building their teams to be agile enough to experiment and adapt quickly.
These examples show you how to get to the next step of AEO:
1. Go beyond tracking AI metrics.
Use Al-driven insights to measure ROI.
2. Track Al search to full conversion.
Track Al results with the rest of your KPIs.
3. Focus on optimizing for humans and Al.
Improve both Al and customer experience.
