This page discusses the next steps for companies that are using AEO, including building an agile team and educating and training employees.

- Text: How can companies
get moving?
Next steps for teams looking to succeed with AEO
Build a truly agile AEO team
The most successful teams are nimble enough
to test and iterate quickly, moving from
insights to changes to results in days, not
weeks. They have access to the right data to
make informed decisions quickly, and they are
empowered to take calculated risks.
Educate and train your teams
There's an enormous education gap between
today's SEOs and the AEOs of tomorrow.
The right training can help your teams
understand how to measure and benchmark
results, balance Al optimization with human
readability, and create clear, concise content.
They need to understand how to identify
opportunities for improvement, test new
approaches, and quickly implement changes.
