- Context: This page discusses the role of AEO in improving SEO performance, as well as the need for tools and training in order to make AEO more effective.
- Text: Why AEO is critical to improving SEO performance
Answer engine optimization (AEO) is the next evolution in SEO. But it’s more than just a
trend. AEO is about ensuring your content is accurate, comprehensive, and relevant. All of
which is key to SEO performance.
While there are many ways to improve SEO, AEO is increasingly becoming the go-to
strategy for brands looking to rise in the ranks. That’s because the way people search is
evolving. More searches are conducted using voice, and with that comes a need for more
natural-sounding results. By optimizing your content for answer engines, you can ensure
that your brand is ready for the future of search.
How to equip teams with the right AEO tools
and training
Answer engine optimization (AEO) is the key to unlocking your brand’s potential. But
without the right tools and training, your efforts may fall flat.
First, ensure your team understands the basics of AEO. This includes understanding the
different types of answer engines and how they work. In addition, they should be familiar
with the latest trends in AEO.
Second, provide your team with the right tools. This includes tools that can help them
analyze data, track results, and optimize content.
Finally, provide your team with ongoing training. This will help them stay up-to-date on the
latest trends in AEO and ensure they are using the best strategies.
The AEO Divide
