# Context:
This page discusses four key steps that enable teams to excel in Answer Engine Optimization (AEO). It elaborates on aspects like content optimization, performance tracking, adapting to customer demands, and integrating AI.

# Text:
Here’s how to get started:
1. Optimize your content and metadata for
discoverability.
Teams using AEO are focusing on
optimizing content for discoverability on
search engines, and in answer engines.
Ensure content is easily discoverable
with clearly defined metadata.
2. Continually track and measure
performance.
AEO demands continual monitoring of
performance against defined KPIs.
Leverage metrics to assess the
effectiveness of AEO strategies and
make data-driven adjustments.
3. Stay agile and adapt to customer
demands.
AEO is an ongoing process requiring
flexibility and adaptability. Adjust
strategies based on customer
feedback, market trends, and
algorithm updates.
4. Integrate AI and automation to
streamline workflows.
AI and automation technologies play a
pivotal role in AEO. By automating tasks
such as keyword research, content
optimization, and performance
monitoring, teams can focus on more
strategic initiatives.

