- Context: This page discusses AEO assessments. It describes how the assessment will measure 1) how your content ranks for search terms, 2) how relevant and helpful your content is to your audience, and 3) how well your content answers questions about your brand.
- Text: AEO Assessment

  What you will get out of your AEO assessment
  1. Assess how discoverable your content is
  We’ll look into where your content currently ranks for search terms related to your offerings.

  2. Assess how relevant and helpful your content is to your audience
  We’ll determine how accurately your content meets the needs of your audience.

  3. Assess how well your content answers questions about your brand
  We’ll evaluate whether your content comprehensively answers questions about your brand.

